<section class="w-full relative rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#121215]/90 backdrop-blur-xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 shadow-2xl space-y-8 overflow-hidden font-sans">
  <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">HARDWARE ARCHITECTURE</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Panel Technology Breakdown</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-[#08080a] p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <strong class="text-white block text-sm">Professional IPS (In-Plane Switching)</strong>
      <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">Superior color accuracy and viewing angles. Used in reference monitors. Prone to minor "IPS Glow" in dark environments.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#08080a] p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <strong class="text-white block text-sm">Consumer IPS (Fast IPS / Nano IPS)</strong>
      <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">High refresh rates and good response times for gaming, but lower static contrast ratios compared to VA.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#08080a] p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <strong class="text-white block text-sm">VA Panel (Vertical Alignment)</strong>
      <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">Excellent deep blacks and high contrast (3000:1+). Often used in curved displays. Can exhibit "black smearing" in fast motion.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#08080a] p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-2">
      <strong class="text-white block text-sm">OLED (Organic LED) & QD-OLED</strong>
      <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">Self-lit pixels deliver true black, near-instant response times, and infinite contrast. Subject to Auto Brightness Limiting (ABL).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>